
"smart_sources:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/culture/Culture - The Hallal Celebration.md": {"path":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/culture/Culture - The Hallal Celebration.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"1xs8rm9","at":1777331817895},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1777002481305,"size":1752,"at":1777331817922,"hash":"1xs8rm9"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,25],"#Culture - The Hallal Celebration":[27,28],"#A major annual festival celebrated by the Valheimr clans, such as the Ragnar clan.":[29,33],"#A major annual festival celebrated by the Valheimr clans, such as the Ragnar clan.#{1}":[30,33]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":50,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["hallal","valheimr festival","ragnar festival","mead hall"],"refine_keys":["valheimr","ragnar","clan","feast","mead","festival"],"position":"before","depth":4,"scanDepth":1,"summary":"**What:** The Hallal Celebration is a major annual Valheimr festival (e.g., Ragnar clan) of feasting, drinking, singing, and camaraderie in a rustic mead hall.\n\n**When to select:** When the story features Valheimr clan members engaging in unrestrained festivity, reaffirming clan bonds, or contrasting their culture against formal celebrations (e.g., Flora). Use during narrative beats involving clan gatherings, seasonal rites, or temporary respite from northern hardships.\n\n**Key relationships:** Celebrated by Valheimr clans (especially Ragnar). Contrasts sharply with Flora’s refined, formal celebrations."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/culture/Culture - The Hallal Celebration.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"12qict0","at":1777331817895},"key":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/culture/Culture - The Hallal Celebration.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,25],"size":907,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
